OL,3,AFive EU countries expected to announce
OL,4,Amigrant deportation centre in Rwanda
OL,5,
OL,6,FFive EU countries are expected to
OL,7,Fannounce the creation of a migrant
OL,8,Fdeportation centre in the landlocked
OL,9,FAfrican country Rwanda, according to
OL,10,Fdiplomatic sources, part of a broader
OL,11,Fpush to boost deportations and curb
OL,12,Firregular migration.
OL,14,FGermany, Denmark, Austria, Greece and
OL,15,Fthe Netherlands said in September they
OL,16,Fwere working towards a deal with a
OL,17,Fnon-EU country to host "return hubs".
OL,19,FIn August, Rwanda said it had begun
OL,20,F"preliminary discussions" with several
OL,21,FEuropean states.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
